{"id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-alt-complexity.md","title":"交替时间与空间查询类","display":"df-alt-complexity — 交替时间与空间查询类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-alt-complexity","aliases":["29-df-alt-complexity"],"display":"df-alt-complexity — 交替时间与空间查询类","depends_on":["[[29-df-atm]]","[[29-df-atm-accept]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"§2.4, pp.35–36, DjVu scans 50–51","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-alt-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-alt-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-alt-complexity — 交替时间与空间查询类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aab8d6d79a93409\" href=\"?note=2aab8d6d79a93409\" title=\"29-df-atm-accept\">29-df-atm-accept</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§2.4, pp.35–36, DjVu scans 50–51"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>每个有限结构按任一线性序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a> 编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{A,&lt;}=\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau((A,&lt;))\">\\(x_{A,&lt;}=\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau((A,&lt;))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)\\)</span> 为该输入所有分支的最大步数，非停机分支记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Space}_M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Space}_M(x)\\)</span> 为所有分支访问的最大工作带格数（含输入索引带）。这些是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"77e57ed488a01e39\" href=\"?note=77e57ed488a01e39\" title=\"29-df-atm\">29-df-atm</a> 底层标准机器的资源接口。</li>\n<li>原书对一般结构的资源参数取域大小；具体词汇固定时编码长度与它多项式相关。无词汇参数的类记号按当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 简写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})&lt;\\infty\\land(A\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x_{A,&lt;}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})&lt;\\infty\\land(A\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x_{A,&lt;}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Space}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq c\\,s(n_A)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Space}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq c\\,s(n_A)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq c\\,t(n_A)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall&lt;\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,&lt;})\\leq c\\,t(n_A)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.24 后及 Theorem 2.25 前，印刷页35–36、扫描页50–51。修复未量化的输入 x、未定义的 Accepts 调用和任意无序载体无法直接编码的问题。此处要求对每一种输入枚举都正确并在所有分支停机，因而定义的仍是同构不变查询。和本书机器类约定一致，以域大小 n 表示资源参数；二进制字符串输入作为特殊词汇时 n 同时是字符串长度。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atm-accept]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","em