cides}_\\tau(M,S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall<\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,<})<\\infty\\land(A\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accepts}(M,x_{A,<}))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall<\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Space}_M(x_{A,<})\\leq c\\,s(n_A)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{ATM}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\forall<\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;(n_A\\geq N\\to\\operatorname{Time}_M(x_{A,<})\\leq c\\,t(n_A)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ATIME}[t,\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":3125,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-alt-complexity]]、[[29-thm-alt-relations]] — `\\mathrm{ASPACE}`、`\\mathrm{ATIME}` 及其关系"},{"id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为固定有限输入词汇；$x_{A,<},n_A,\\operatorname{Decides}_\\tau(M,S),\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]]，$\\operatorname{Accepts}$ 采用 [[29-df-atm-accept]]。"},{"id":"1e50676dbd9fe9bc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"单参数 $\\mathrm{ASPACE}[s],\\mathrm{ATIME}[t]$ 采用 [[29-df-alt-complexity]] 对当前 $\\tau$ 的简写，确定性资源类也按同一词汇限制。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-alt-complexity]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-alt-complexity]]"}],"